  "meta": {
    "description": "IMPROVED: Grab Profile Sub-Agent. Changes from original: (1) Added Prompt Builder node to structure the GPT prompt properly. (2) GPT now uses responseFormat: json_object — no brittle string parsing. (3) Parse GPT Response node safely JSON.parses with try/catch and meaningful error messages. (4) SerpAPI HTTP request has retry logic (3 retries, 2s delay). (5) Filters SerpAPI results to actual profile URLs — no company pages or posts. (6) Strips URL tracking params before saving. (7) Added Dedup Check (sheet lookup) BEFORE appending — prevents duplicate rows. (8) False branch on If node is now handled — returns a structured error instead of dangling. (9) All terminal nodes use Set node with consistent field names (result, status, linkedinUrl) so the main agent gets predictable output. (10) sessionId passed through entire flow for traceability."
  }
